	for {
		select {
		case <-ticker.C:
			r.RunOnce(ctx)
		case <-ctx.Done():
			return
		}
	}
}
```

Webhook delivery uses four background goroutines started in `init()` in `internal/webhook/webhook.go` when the package is loaded (via `cmd/memos/main.go` and API webhook handlers). They read from `asyncPostQueue` when handlers call `PostAsync` — event-driven, not scheduled.

The cron scheduler in `internal/scheduler/` (see `internal/scheduler/doc.go`) is only referenced from its own tests/examples, not from `server/` or `cmd/`.
